OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical music.
OL,8,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     FThe BBC Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,10,     Fwith Chief Conductor John
OL,11,     FStorgards in Nielsen and
OL,12,     FRautavaara. They are joined by
OL,13,     FSimone Lamsma in Sibelius's Violin
OL,14,     FConcerto.
OL,15,G2145 The Essay: Jazz Among The British
OL,16,     FGeoffrey Smith continues his
OL,17,     Fseries on changing perceptions of
OL,18,     Fjazz in Britain, focusing on the
OL,19,     Fvisits of two celebrated American
OL,20,     Fartists, Duke Ellington and Bud
OL,21,     FFreeman.
